      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TL: A(0,0) x B(0,2) + A(0,1) x B(1,2) = the first 2 terms of C(0,2). Barrier.",
